# ── Firebase App Check ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Development: leave blank — Firebase auto-generates a debug token (check browser console).
# Register that token in Firebase Console → App Check → Apps → Manage debug tokens.
# Production: add your reCAPTCHA v3 site key (https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin).
